  "title": "HVAC Rooftop Unit Asset Register and Lifecycle Record",
  "subtitle": "Maintain one authoritative RTU record for identity, roof location, nameplate data, configuration, controls, access and isolation, documents, maintenance strategy, condition, capital decisions, changes, and retirement.",
